        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poop Game</strong> — the smash-hit mobile title — is finally coming to <strong>Steam!</strong><br>Enjoy this Suika Game-style falling puzzle that’s simple to play, incredibly addictive, and now fully optimized for PC with a larger screen and smoother controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop poop into the toilet and merge matching colors to create bigger ones!<br>Keep merging to reach the ultimate form — the <strong>Rainbow Poop!</strong><br>While the controls are simple, each move requires strategy.<br>Where you drop it and which color you aim for will determine your final score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag left or right with your mouse to adjust the drop position, then release to drop the poop.<br>Anyone can pick it up instantly — it’s easy to learn and satisfying to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features on Steam</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Ranking Support</strong><br>Compete with players from around the globe and see how your “poop skills” measure up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized for PC</strong><br>Enjoy high-resolution visuals and smooth gameplay on a big screen.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Suika Game-style falling puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique, oddly satisfying visuals and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mechanics with surprising strategic depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, casual gameplay perfect for short sessions</p></li></ul>",
